* Advanced Dynamic Testbench for LM358
.include LM358_harness2_blueprint_anchor.cir
XDUT IN1_P IN1_N OUT1 IN2_P IN2_N OUT2 V_P V_N NC1 NC2 NC3 LM358

* Power and Grounding
V_V_N V_N 0 0
V_V_P V_P 0 15

* Dynamic Signal Stimulus (Example for IN1)
VINP IN1_P 0 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k 10u)
VINN IN1_N 0 DC 2.5

* Load Termination for OUT1
RL OUT1 0 10k

* Fourier Analysis Setup (Example for 1kHz)
.four 1k 9 V(OUT1)

* Measurement Directives (Must use .meas tran)
.meas tran v_rms RMS V(OUT1) from=15m to=20m
.meas tran icc AVG -I(V_V_P) from=10m to=20m

* Simulation Control (Only .tran allowed)
.tran 10u 20m 10m
.control
run
.endc
.end
